CBDevDesk
CBDevDesk Phase 2 is a collaborative cloud coding workspace
💻 Online IDE — users write and edit code in the browser.
👥 Real-time collaboration — multiple users can edit the same file together.
🔐 User accounts & permissions — owners, admins, editors, and viewers.
📁 Project/file management — projects have their own workspace and files.
🌿 Git integration — users can commit changes and view Git history.
⚡ Backend API — manages users, projects, files, permissions, and collaboration access.
🧩 Scalable architecture — designed to eventually support Redis, persistent collaboration state, and isolated code execution.
